#37100
Credit where it's due, holmes~
   Please request a copy of the excel file to see all the details of this area.
Also contains quest goals.  100 room city with 8 shopkeepers that offer players
the chance to make some gold or pick up some unique items.  All shopkeepers have
10 random greet triggers for player entry into the shop.  Allows for players in
the room to see another player enter, regardless of spells/sneak.  North and
south walls have room entry triggers that correspond to the environment and also
load optional mobs that players can fight for extra experience.  8 optional boss
mobs, 6 additional lower boss mobs, and one level 51 with decent lowbie gear or
for players to make some profit.  Citizens/Guards wander as well.  QM has 30 QP
available with a total of 20 quests.  Sometimes the QM will reward the player
with "tokens" that can be redeemed at a later time for extra rewards such as
group haste/sanc/fly pots.  Quests are NOT repeatable but offer incentive for
the player to complete then all.
~
371 3152 12 0 0 0 255 0
S
#37101
The Center of the Ancient City~
   The entire city converges to this point.  The machines and people bustle
about you seemingly intent on previous engagements.  While ignoring you it would
be wise not to interfere with anything here.  The entire populace seems to have
taken a heightened sense of alertness.  Large onyx steps lead up to the base of
an immense fountain full of molten lava.
~
