#37102
Black Mountain Road~
   The passage that bisects the city from north to south is very wide.  With
very large, intricate onyx buildings to the east and west that scrape the stars,
you can also see the lava flow beneath the city through randomly placed plastic
viewing windows.  A black mountain range can be seen to the north.  The center
of the city is just to the south.
