#37104
The intersection of Black Mountain Road and Emerald Way~
   The passage that bisects the city from north to south is very wide.  Here,
the large onyx structures scrape the stars on each corner of this intersection.
The captain's barracks can be seen to the southeast.  The southern gate lies
very far to the south.  The paths that lead east and west will take you to some
of the shops this city has to offer.  This city is vibrant with life.
~
