#37107
Before the Mountain~
   This is the one point of access into the city besides the main entrance
above.  A large hole has been cut into the onyx here and replaced with a large
stone slab.  Large gears built into the wall here have been attached to chains
that operate the opening and closing of the stone.  If one were to gain access
to opening the stone the black mountains of the north await.  The skies to the
north remain black even during the high point of light during the day.  A single
road leads away from the safety of the city.
~
