#37114
Elemental Way~
   The street that bisects the city from east to west is very wide.  The path
slopes towards the center of the city and allows view to the far eastern wall.
The city seems to have been built this way to allow the peace keepers and
security here a broad view no matter the location they were in.  This is also
dependent on if they stick to the main streets.  The captain of security's
barracks are to the north.
~
