#37115
Elemental Way - The Captain's Barracks~
   Slightly the east of the center of the city lies a large, and quite
extravagant barracks.  An immense lava flow flows north to south but the
barracks, and the bridge you are standing on, are built on a complex system on
onyx beams and stone.  The pure accuracy with which these supports have been
made is indeed astonishing.  The entrance is to the north side of the road.
~
