#37116
Intersection of 16th Street Main and Elemental Way~
   The street that bisects the city from east to west is very wide.  The path
slopes towards the center of the city and allows view to the far eastern wall.
The intersection here allows for travel to the north and south.  Like the rest
of the city, some parts of the street are transparent and put on display the
lava flow and the city's support structure above that.  Here, the smell of
sulfur is less and the smell of the sea is more.
