#37121
Elemental Way - The Guard's Hall~
   Slightly to the west of the center of the city sits a large command post.  
The building's exterior is composed mostly of onyx with some old tree bark used
as a trim.  The faint glow of the black northern mountains reflects off it's
glassy surface.  The steps leading up to the door are engraved with strange
writing in their faces.  The door is a blood red.
~
