#37126
The Western Road~
   The street that lines the western cliffs is a little less crowded than the
northern and southern walls.  Granted this is due to needing less security, the
perimeter of the city is frequented by the citizens here.  The mountain range to
the north offers a disturbing view of the chaos that surrounds them.  Lava flows
can be seen steaming down their valleys.  The smell of sulfur however, starts to
fade.
