#37131
Intersection of The Western Road and Frontage Way~
   This corner of the city gives attention to the onyx cliffs to the west and
the black mountains of the north.  A critical point of defense in this city, it
relatively gives all attention to the mountains.  The heat here is much more
intense than the southern parts but the elementals don't seem to notice, or even
care.  The smell of sulfur here is overpowering.  East or south are your
choices.
~
