#37132
Frontage Way~
   The street runs west and east along the northernmost section of the city.  A
large parapet wall is stocked heavily with guards and supplies should an
assailant advance from the mountains.  The wall is made completely out of onyx.
The cliffs to the west seem to blot out the entire sky.  As they draw close the
security forces seem to thin out.
~
