The Eastern Road~
   The street that lines the eastern cliffs is a little less crowded than the
northern and southern walls.  Granted this is due to needing less security, the
perimeter of the city is frequented by the citizens here.  A complex system of
nets and beams cover the entire city to protect itself from the onyx chunks that
occasionally fall from the cliffs.  Magic has to help deflect the very large
pieces that would otherwise decimate the city.
