#37153
Intersection of Sapphire Street and The Eastern Road~
   This corner of the city is heavily fortified at well.  This point is meant to
serve as another eye to the city, scanning the southern horizon for any force
that may try to take the city from the ocean.  This of course will still be a
daunting task as just outside the city wall are vertical cliffs that lead
hundreds of feet down into the open ocean.  This city is in a very nice
position.
~
