#37170
Lava Lane~
   A small alley runs north and south here between two large onyx structures.  
The mountain range to the north can be seen and you can certainly smell that
it's there.  A few elementals here hang out in the corners hoping to lure some
travelers out of their gold coins.  It would be very dark if not for the
transparent street that you are walking on.  The lava flow beneath gives off a
very bright orange light.
~
