#37171
Intersection of Lava Lane and Emerald Way~
   A large intersection is here, bustling with life.  A peace keeper watches
over the city and the citizens.  Since the location is slightly elevated it
offers perfect views of a large part of the city in all directions.  Tall onyx
structures stand at each corner and you can hear the call of shop keepers to the
north.  Like the city streets, the lava breaks off east and west as it flows to
the south towards the sea.
~
