#37172
Lava Lane~
   A small alley runs north and south here between two large onyx structures.  
There are two shops in this area that offer sustenance to travelers trying their
luck in the mountains of the north.  From here you can see the black smoke that
rises from them.  This alley is rare due to the fact that you can see past some
of the mountains.  Very far in the distance you can make out what appears to be
another city.  From this distance, that would mean their buildings would have to
be colossal.
