#37182
Advantage Armory~
   This shop is located in the northern part of the city.  Like many of the
shops here the floor is made of thick plastic and allows views of the lava that
flows through the city.  There is a large forge in the back of the shop and
glows a bright white.  The walls and ceiling are decorated with suits of armor
dating centuries old and of every race imaginable.  A sign above the door states
"Prices are FINAL".
~
371 132 0 0 0 1 255 0
D3
~
~
0 37100 37172
S
#37183
The Swinging Swordsman~
   This shop is located in the north western part of the city.  Like many of the
shops the floor allows views down to where the lava flows beneath the city.  
Behind the counter there is a large lava pit with various types of weapons, in
various stages of completion, strewn about the area.  The walls are adorned with
many types of weapons for sale.  It is very hot in here and the smell of sulfur
is very strong.
~
