#37184
The Wizard's Pouch~
   This shop is nestled in between two smaller buildings in the southern part of
the city.  While not very large in size, the room is nevertheless packed floor
to ceiling with all sorts of items.  On the walls are old contraptions and items
that older generations used to harvest the lava.  Like the other shops, you can
see it flowing beneath your feet.
~
