#37185
Diamond in the Rough~
   This shop is on the first level of some smaller buildings in the southern
part of the city.  Like so many of the shops here, the floor is made out of a
very thick plastic and displays the lava that flows beneath the city.  On the
walls here are various displays documenting how the machines here harvest
precious metals and jewels out of the surrounding cliff sides.  A small lock box
sits on the counter.
~
