#37186
Kiki's Scrolls and Such~
   This shop is on the first level of one of the larger buildings in the
southern part of the city.  Parchments, quills, and papers of all sizes and
color are displayed beneath a large glass shield.  Behind the counter are
endless stacks of what appear to be scrolls and other such items that are the
same as the ones on display.  The floor is made of a thick sort of plastic,
resistant to heat, and clearly displays the lava flowing beneath the shop.
~
