#37187
The Melting Pot~
   This shop is nestled in between two taller buildings in the southern part of
the city.  The shop is an absolute mess and could probably stand to use some
organization.  Small pots bubble in the back and countless glass bottles filled
with different colored liquids line the walls.  The place smells of liquor and
pipe tobacco.  The Melting Pot is one of the few places in the city the
elementals avoid.
~
