#37188
The Bottomless Barrel~
   This shop is located in the northern part of the city.  Like most of the
shops here the floor is made of a thick plastic and allows view of the lava that
flows beneath the city.  While elementals do not need to drink to survive, they
were smart enough to install these shops to cater to the occasional traveler
such as yourself.  A large pool of water is behind the counter and is very full.
~
