The Stalk Shop~
   This shop rests in the northern part of the city close to the black
mountains.  Like most of the shops here the floor is made out of a thick plastic
and allows view of the lava that flows beneath the city.  While elementals do
not need to eat they were smart enough to have a shop to make profit from
