#37190
The Guard's Hall - Entrance~
   The entrance to the command past is much like the entrance to the Captain's
Barracks.  The floor allows views down into the lava and the columns that are
supporting the building.  A large bulletin board takes up the western wall and
has various tactical maps and safety posters pinned to it.  Large onyx columns
support the arched ceiling and are braced together and to the walls.
