#37191
The Guard's Hall - Locker Room~
   This is the where the elementals gear up for a shift.  A large pit in the
center of the room heats the large pot of water in the middle of it.  This in
turn has made the room very steamy.  Large pieces of armor scatter throughout
the room.  The vegetation doesn't move very much in here.  You can attribute
that to the steam.
~
