#37192
The Guard's Hall - The Armory~
   This is where the elemental guards forge their own weapons.  Behind a large
onyx counter there is an open pit that smokes and hisses.  Blocks of unrefined
steel ore surround the room amongst piles of various weapons.  Groups of guards
gather here to replace their weapons, which due to their vegetative
enhancements, wear out very quickly.
