The Guard's Hall - Storage~
   This room is used for nothing more than storage.  Large boxes are stacked
floor to ceiling and hold various contents.  The elementals seem to avoid this
room altogether.  Centuries of dust have accumulated in the corners and seem to
be a food source of some strange insect.  It's very dark in here.
