#37194
The Captain's Barracks - Entrance~
   The entrance to this building is a true architectural wonder.  Large onyx
pillars spiral high above you to support the arched ceilings overhead.  The
floor is made up of alternating stone and plastic squares.  It would appear that
the floor of this building is supported by columns that stretch far below, into
the lava.  How they have not eroded is equally as puzzling.
~
