#37195
The Captain's Barracks - War Room~
   This room has been fortified heavily from the inside.  Large maps and
tactical charts are pinned to every wall and spread out on the table here.  A
large chair at the end of the table signifies where the head of security sits.
With a closer look at the walls here, you notice different, distinct names
you've heard of on the walls.  This city is well prepared to face any type of
attack.
~
