#37197
The Captain's Barracks - Sleeping Quarters~
   This room is where some of guards will more or less sleep...  If elementals
do indeed sleep.  Nevertheless there are a few large cots layed out against the
northern wall and a rack on the eastern wall to rest their weapons.  A large
window on the southern wall allows the guards from this room to still keep a
partial eye on the center of town.  It is quite cozy here.
