#37198
A steep rocky path~
   Just north of the city gate is a small rocky path that leads into the
mountains.  The lava flows that line each side of the path give off an intense
heat and the smell of sulfur sets the air on fire.  The mountain range stretches
are far as one can see east and west with ever rising smoke .  Belching black
fumes pollute the sky with dark clouds.  A rumbling can be heard in the far
distance.  The path continues north and south.
~
