#37199
The Inn of the Elemental~
   You stand in a room unlike most that this city has to offer.  A warm fire
occupies a large pit in the center of the room.  Behind a large desk sits a
small, feminine elemental.  Business is slow here as the city experiences
relatively few outsiders.  Large fur rugs adorn the walls and floor.  Aside from
that this room is pretty much empty.  Many doors line the walls and lead to
chambers that are for rent, hourly of course.
~
